        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-20/pdf/FR-1986-05-20.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. R e p o r t. The board shall report its findings to the President with respect \nto these disputes w ithin 30 days from the date of its creation."
    },
